SUMMARY:All Y’all Come to Camp
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260904T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260906T170000
DTSTAMP:20250908T103506Z
UID:MEC-64974b2750b80d7f9526943aab6b8baa@browncounty.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260904T200000
SEQUENCE:5
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://browncounty.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/
 09/Untitled-design-57.jpg
CATEGORIES:Family Friendly,Happening,Outdoor Adventure,Special Events,Summ
 er
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20250908
DESCRIPTION:Spend the weekend surrounded by nature\, with classic camp act
 ivities like campfires\, worship\, games\, and outdoor adventures – plus
  plenty of time to relax and unwind at your own pace. Whether you want to 
 dive into all the action or simply enjoy the peaceful setting\, this weeke
 nd is yours to enjoy.\nJoin us for a refreshing weekend filled with fun\, 
 adventure and community. Waycross staff will lead a variety of activities\
 , and participants are encouraged to take part as much or as little as the
 y like.\n\n\nSeptember 4-6\, 2026\n\n\nCheck-in: 4-6pm\n\n\nCheck-out: 1pm
 \n\n\n\n\nAll ages welcome\, minors must be accompanied by an adult.\n\n\n
 Program Rates\n\n\nAttendance cost is calculated during online registratio
 n\, depending on your lodging selection. Rates are per person and include 
 program fees\, lodging and meals.\n\n\nConference Center – Single Occupa
 ncy: $400 per person\n\n\nConference Center – Double Occupancy: $330 per
  person\n\n\nMain House/Sleeping Wing – Multi-Occupancy: $260 per person
 \n\n\nCabins – Multi-Occupancy (adult): $180 per person\n\n\nYouth 10-17
 : $200 per person\n\n\nChildren 4-9: $160 per person\n\n\n3 and under: $0\
 n\n\n\n\n\n\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20260319
LOCATION:4879 Richards Rd\, Morgantown\, IN
PRIORITY:5
TRANSP:OPAQUE
URL:https://browncounty.com/events/all-yall-come-to-camp-2/
X-SOURCE:Brown County Events
END:VEVENT
