 ome\, heartbroken in the world’s happiest city. However\, with help from 
 a determined local and a few meddling couples\, his ruined honeymoon beco
 mes an adventure that he never expected.\n\nRATING: PG\nLENGTH: 1hr 40min
 s\nFORMAT: DCP
