UID:2607162zq-nU81k0WVR-LuRdijiw
DESCRIPTION:*Come to the CBVN Volunteer Fair to find your next passion pro
 ject!* \n\nThe 2025 City of Bloomington Volunteer Network (CBVN) Volunteer
  Fair will take place Saturday\, September 5 from 10 a.m. - 1:30 p.m.\, at
  Bloomington City Hall (401 N. Morton Street) in the City Hall Atrium and 
 on the Fernandez Plaza. This free community event is held each year to int
 roduce the public to dozens of local\, volunteer-powered organizations and
  community groups. The fair will be held in conjunction with the Saturday 
 Bloomington Community Farmers’ Market.
LOCATION:Bloomington City Hall & Fernandez Plaza
URL:https://www.bloomingtonvolunteernetwork.org/cbvn-volunteer-fair/
