 li></ul><h3><strong>About Your Facilitator</strong></h3><p>  Dedaimia Whit
 ney earned an MFA in fiction from Indiana University under the direction o
 f Scott Russell Sanders. She taught creative writing at Franklin College f
 or many years. She has served the museum as a docent since 2019. Her favor
 ite works of art are those that are both visually stimulating and thought-
 provoking.</p>
