 </u></a></p></h3><h3><b>Hours of Operation</b></h3><ul><li>Bryan Park Pool
  is open May 23-Aug. 3\, 2026.</li><li>Operating hours are 11 a.m.-7 p.m. 
 daily.</li><li>Pool is closed Tuesday\, Aug. 4 through Friday\, Aug. 7.</l
 i><li>Open Saturday and Sunday only beginning Saturday\, Aug. 8 and ending
  Monday\, Sept. 7 (Labor Day). Pool is open Sept. 7.</li></ul><p>Operating
  hours are subject to change. The pool\, or portions of the pool\, may clo
 se due to lifeguard shortages\, low attendance\, or threatening weather. F
 or updates on hours of operation or the open status of Bryan Park Pool and
