 enced riders.  These Sunday rides feature lower mileage (19-24 miles) and
  slower paces than Saturday touring rides.  They use Bloomington area low
  traffic roads.<br><br>Non-members should sign up for a <a href="https://
 www.bloomingtonbicycleclub.org/services-3" target="_blank"><u><u>free tria
 l membership</u></u></a>\, which includes signing a liability waiver\, pr
 ior to participation.
