DESCRIPTION:Route/Event link: <a href="https://ridewithgps.com/events/500
 451-beginner-social-ride-west-side-neighborh" target="_blank">https://ride
 withgps.com/events/500451-beginner-social-ride-west-side-neighborh</a><br>
 <br><p>These rides use area bike paths and quiet neighborhood roads and av
 oid the big hills. They are perfect for beginners\, families\, or those re
 ady to get back into cycling. Each ride will feature <b>a stop for refres
 hment and social time.</b>  Give this a try!</p><p>This ride uses bike p
 aths and mostly quiet neighborhood roads (there are two short stretches of
  rural two lane roads (less than a mile in total)\, with as gentle hills a
 s possible in Bloomington. Ride starts and ends at the Trades District Pla
 za. Parking on street and in garage are free on Sunday. Trades District Pl
 aza is across the street from Upland Brew Pub (open to all ages) where we 
 will enjoy some post ride social time.</p><p>This is a <b>no-drop ride—w
 e will stay with you</b>. Ride with others—it's safer and more fun! Lear
 n and explore beginner-friendly cycling routes around Bloomington.</p><p>N
 on-members should\, prior to participation\, sign up for a <a href="https:
 //secure.getmeregistered.com/get_information.php?event_id=137889" target="
 _blank"><u><u><u><u><u>free trial membership</u></u></u></u></u></a>\, whi
 ch includes electronically signing a liability waiver.</p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260902T011256Z
LOCATION:Trades District Plaza\, 380 W. 10th street.
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
X-SOURCE:Bloomington Bicycle Club
END:VEVENT
