BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-ID:gcal_c_siu0d8ohqr5j5p936tig34emts
SUMMARY:Labor Day Weekend Picnic
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260906T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260906T190000
DTSTAMP:20260905T041553Z
UID:0bdhhot3hipmt745mu47m8k1j2@google.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260906T160000
SEQUENCE:0
CREATED:20260806T015230Z
DESCRIPTION:<p>Join the Stonewall Democrats of South Central Indiana and t
 he Monroe Co Democrats Club for their annual summer Picnic! The picnic wil
 l be held at the Sycamore Shelter in Lower Cascades Park between 4pm and 7
 pm\, with games\, speakers\, music\, great food and great people. This is 
 a pitch-in event\, so please bring a covered side dish and/or drinks. Frie
 d chicken and brats will be provided\, courtesy of MCDC.</p>
