X-SOURCE-URLS:{"McCormick's Creek State Park": "https://on.IN.gov/mccormickscreek"}
X-SOURCE-ID:localist_mccormicks_creek
SUMMARY:Fossil Discovery and Geology Hike\, McCormick's Creek State Park
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260907T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260907T150000
UID:6fe08d683b2bc44fdd941bc64c3afd34@events.in.gov
DESCRIPTION:(Hike) Take a trip back in time to when Indiana was an ocean f
 loor! Learn about ancient creatures from the skeletons they left behind in
  the limestone. Join Naturalist Kaitlyn on a rugged hike on Trail 3. We wi
 ll scrabble through rocks in the creek to learn about fossils older than d
 inosaurs and how the canyon was formed and altered over geological history
 . We begin our 0.8-mile hike in front of the Canyon Inn.
LOCATION:McCormick's Creek State Park\, Canyon Inn\, 250 McCormick's Creek
  Park Road\, Spencer\, IN 47460
URL:https://on.IN.gov/mccormickscreek
X-SOURCE:McCormick's Creek State Park
END:VEVENT
