X-SOURCE-ID:events_livewhale_64
SUMMARY:OLL Callout Meeting
DTSTART:20260908T160000Z
DTEND:20260908T170000Z
DTSTAMP:20260728T133800Z
UID:20260908T160000Z-2363263@events.iu.edu
RECURRENCE-ID:20260908T160000Z
CATEGORIES:Student-run
DESCRIPTION:Outreach for Legal Literacy (OLL) is a pro bono student organi
 zation that partners with Bloomington elementary schools to teach 5th grad
 e students about the legal profession\, the justice system\, and the role 
 lawyers play in society. Through interactive lessons\, law students help i
 nspire curiosity about the law and promote legal literacy in our community
 .  Volunteers also assist 5th grade students in fun and exciting mock tria
 ls to practice the skills taught to them (last year's criminal mock trial 
 involved thrilling Minecraft body-camera footage)!  Whether you're passion
 ate about community engagement\, education\, or simply looking for a meani
 ngful way to give back\, we'd love to have you join us! No prior teaching 
 experience is required—just a willingness to learn and make a positive i
 mpact. Join us to learn about the program\, how to get involved\, commitme
 nt levels\, and additional information!&#160\;
GEO:39.165074;-86.526424
LAST-MODIFIED:20260728T173800Z
LOCATION:LOWELL E. BAIER HALL/IU MAURER SCHOOL OF LAW
URL:https://events.iu.edu/lawiub/event/2363263-oll-callout-meeting
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  Outreach for Legal Literacy (OLL) is a p
 ro bono student organization that partners with Bloomington elementary sch
 ools to teach 5th grade students about the legal profession\, the justice 
 system\, and the role lawyers play in society. Through interactive lessons
 \, law students help inspire curiosity about the law and promote legal lit
 eracy in our community.</p><p>  Volunteers also assist 5th grade students 
 in fun and exciting mock trials to practice the skills taught to them (las
 t year's criminal mock trial involved thrilling Minecraft body-camera foot
 age)!</p><p>  Whether you're passionate about community engagement\, educa
 tion\, or simply looking for a meaningful way to give back\, we'd love to 
 have you join us! No prior teaching experience is required—just a willin
 gness to learn and make a positive impact. Join us to learn about the prog
 ram\, how to get involved\, commitment levels\, and additional information
 !&#160\;</p>
X-LIVEWHALE-CONTACT-INFO:<p>Brennan Cox&#160\;<br />\nPresident of Outreac
 h for Legal Literacy&#160\;</p>
X-LIVEWHALE-ID:2363263
X-LIVEWHALE-TAGS:Outreach for Legal Literacy
X-LIVEWHALE-TIMEZONE:America/New_York
X-LIVEWHALE-TYPE:events
X-SOURCE:IU Maurer School of Law
END:VEVENT
