DESCRIPTION:<u></u><br><br><span>This group emphasizes earlier\, moderate-
 paced rides with routes planned in advance and posted on the ride calendar
 . This is a no drop ride\, but not a beginner's ride.  Expect an overall 
 average moving speed of 12 - 15 mph.  Distances vary from 20 to a little 
 over 30 miles.  Early season rides will be at the lower end of the distan
 ce scale.  During colder weather the ride departs at 1:00pm.  </span><b
 r><br>Non-members should sign up for a <a href="https://www.bloomingtonbi
 cycleclub.org/services-3" target="_blank">free trial membership</a>\,  w
 hich includes signing a liability waiver\, prior to participation.<br><br
 ><br><u></u>
