DESCRIPTION:History of the Russian Old Believers on Polish Lands: 17th&#82
 11\;20th Centuriesis an English translation from the Polish original of Eu
 geniusz Iwaniec's 1977 extensively researched and sourced book on the Russ
 ian Old Believers from the time of the schism in the Russian Orthodox Chur
 ch in the 1660s. It was published in 2026 by Slavica Publishers. (https://
 slavica.indiana.edu/history-of-the-russian-old-believers-on-polish-lands/)
 Prof. Jeff Holdeman is the director of undergraduate studies in SLAV and h
 olds a PhD in Slavic Linguistics (Ohio State\, 2002). He has been research
 ing Priestless Russian Old Believers and their descendants in the eastern 
 US\, Poland\, Lithuania\, Latvia\, Estonia\, Ukraine\, and Belarus since 1
 998.
