X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Events Livewhale 64": "https://events.iu.edu/lawiub/event/2402138-intellectual-property-association-ipa-call-out"}
X-SOURCE-ID:events_livewhale_64
SUMMARY:IPA / SELS / DATA / ChIPs Call Out
DTSTART:20260910T160000Z
DTEND:20260910T170000Z
DTSTAMP:20260831T123357Z
UID:20260910T160000Z-2402138@events.iu.edu
RECURRENCE-ID:20260910T160000Z
CATEGORIES:Student-run
DESCRIPTION:Join IPA\, SELS\, DATA and ChIPs at their annual callout meeti
 ng!Intellectual Property Association: We pride ourselves on our interdisci
 plinary approach to intellectual property. We host professional events\, f
 acilitate networking opportunities\, and build community.SELS is dedicated
  to helping students explore careers in the sports and entertainment indus
 tries. We host guest speakers\, organize career panels\, and connect membe
 rs with professionals working in media\, sports law\, music\, film\, and b
 eyond.DATA: Data\, AI\, and Technology Association for Law (DATA) is an or
 ganization focused on exposing law students to developments at the interse
 ction of law\, data\, artificial intelligence\, cybersecurity\, privacy\, 
 and emerging technology.ChIPs: The Maurer chapter of Chiefs in Intellectua
 l Property's goal is to empower historically underrepresented communities 
 to achieve their full potential as IP students and practitioners. Through 
 social and professional events\, we hope to foster an inclusive environmen
 t with mutual support and informal mentoring.  Come meet the Executive Boa
 rd from the organizations\, our faculty advisors\, and your peers with sim
 ilar interests!
GEO:39.165074;-86.526424
LAST-MODIFIED:20260902T172133Z
LOCATION:Lowell E. Baier Hall - DeLaney Moot Court Room - 123
URL:https://events.iu.edu/lawiub/event/2402138-intellectual-property-assoc
 iation-ipa-call-out
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  Join IPA\, SELS\, DATA and ChIPs at thei
 r annual callout meeting!</p><p><strong>Intellectual Property Association:
 </strong> We pride ourselves on our interdisciplinary approach to intellec
 tual property. We host professional events\, facilitate networking opportu
 nities\, and build community.</p><p><strong>SELS</strong> is dedicated to 
 helping students explore careers in the sports and entertainment industrie
 s. We host guest speakers\, organize career panels\, and connect members w
 ith professionals working in media\, sports law\, music\, film\, and beyon
 d.</p><p><strong>DATA:</strong> Data\, AI\, and Technology Association for
  Law (DATA) is an organization focused on exposing law students to develop
 ments at the intersection of law\, data\, artificial intelligence\, cybers
 ecurity\, privacy\, and emerging technology.</p><p><strong>ChIPs:</strong>
  The Maurer chapter of Chiefs in Intellectual Property's goal is to empowe
 r historically underrepresented communities to achieve their full potentia
 l as IP students and practitioners. Through social and professional events
 \, we hope to foster an inclusive environment with mutual support and info
 rmal mentoring.</p><p>  Come meet the Executive Board from the organizatio
 ns\, our faculty advisors\, and your peers with similar interests!</p>
X-LIVEWHALE-CONTACT-INFO:<p>\n  <strong>Melissa T. Berry<br /></strong><st
 rong><em>Associate Director<br /></em></strong>Center for Intellectual Pro
 perty Research<br />\n  Indiana University Maurer School of Law<br />\n  2
 11 S. Indiana Avenue #304A<br />\n  Bloomington\, IN 47405\n</p>
X-LIVEWHALE-ID:2402138
X-LIVEWHALE-TAGS:Center for Intellectual Property Research|ChIPs Maurer|Da
 ta\, AI\, and Technology Association for Law|Intellectual Property Associa
 tion|Sports &amp\; Entertainment Law Society
X-LIVEWHALE-TIMEZONE:America/New_York
X-LIVEWHALE-TYPE:events
X-SOURCE:IU Maurer School of Law
END:VEVENT
