DESCRIPTION:Join the Maurer Career Services Office on Thursday\, September
  10 from 5:00-7:00 for the 2026 Career Expo.  Designed for first-year law 
 students\, the Career Expo provides an opportunity to connect with attorne
 ys and legal employers from a variety of practice settings. Students can l
 earn about different practice areas and organizations\, ask questions abou
 t legal careers\, and begin building professional relationships early in t
 heir law school experience.  Additional event details\, including the sche
 dule and participating employers\, will be shared as they become available
 .
