 unity to connect with attorneys and legal employers from a variety of prac
 tice settings. Students can learn about different practice areas and organ
 izations\, ask questions about legal careers\, and begin building professi
 onal relationships early in their law school experience.</p><p>  Additiona
 l event details\, including the schedule and participating employers\, wil
 l be shared as they become available.<br /><br /></p>
