 03/544889264_1371960381601239_5851365866810985920_n.jpg
CATEGORIES:Entertainment,Family Friendly,Festivals,Food &amp\; Drink,Happe
 ning,Live Music,Outdoor Concerts,Special Events,Summer
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20260302
DESCRIPTION:We would like to invite you to the 13th GPGT that started in 2
 011!\nA very limited amount of discounted tickets are available now\, as w
 ell as Early Arrival (Thursday) Tickets\, Saturday Only Tickets\, and Prim
 itive RV/Camper/Bus Parking Passes.​\nCome celebrate an amazing weekend 
 with us in the beautiful hills of Brown County!\n2 Days and Nights of Live
  Music\, Live Art\, Light Shows\, Camping\, Workshops\, Kids Activities\, 
 Running Water Restrooms\, Showers($5)\, and much more!!!\nKids 12 and unde
 r are free!There will be free face painting during the day and a kids para
 de on the Saturday of the event.\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20260811
LOCATION:2620 Valley Branch Road\, Nashville\, IN
ORGANIZER;CN=Derrick:MAILTO:gpgtmusicfestival@gmail.com
PRIORITY:5
TRANSP:OPAQUE
