DESCRIPTION:Graduate school application season is approaching! Are you con
 sidering an advanced degree in art\, architecture\, design\, or a related 
 field—but not sure how to prepare a strong application? This Grad School
  Application Workshop is designed to help Eskenazi students understand the
  application process\, organize materials\, and present creative and acade
 mic experiences effectively. You'll learn how to:Research graduate program
 s and evaluate which ones align with your goalsBuild an application timeli
 ne and keep track of important deadlinesPrepare a focused statement of pur
 pose or personal statementStrengthen your résumé or CV for graduate admi
 ssionsRequest strong letters of recommendation and communicate with potent
 ial recommendersAvoid common application mistakes and submit materials wit
 h confidenceWho Should Attend:Eskenazi School of Art\, Architecture + Desi
 gn students from any major who are considering graduate school and want gu
 idance developing a thoughtful\, competitive application.  This event is M
 omentum eligible.
