BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Limestone Post": "https://www.playpensports.com/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:limestone_post
SUMMARY:Toddler Sports Classes
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260912T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260912T120000
UID:260324Hze9RoPkZE-regZ9_xPB2Q
DESCRIPTION:Playpen Sports Academy is a wonderful way to introduce your ch
 ild to the world of sport and physical activity in a non-intimidating envi
 ronment with a small group of other toddlers and parents. The Playpen Spor
 ts Academy Curriculum is focused on a number of different goals including 
 teaching children how to move and use their bodies\, sharing with other ch
 ildren\, interact in social settings\, follow directions\, and most import
 antly how to have fun in a physically active environment. At Playpen Sport
 s Academy\, we are focused as much on the individual development of your c
 hild as we are on sport specific skills that we teach. Because while we ex
 pect some of your children to go on to be great athletes\, we expect all o
 f your children to go on to be great people!
URL:https://www.playpensports.com/
X-SOURCE:Limestone Post
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Brown County State Park": "https://on.in.gov/browncountysp"}
X-SOURCE-ID:localist_brown_county_sp
SUMMARY:Strahl Lake Hike\, Brown County State Park
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260912T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260912T094500
UID:b5ee64a01c0654c97d966599ed63f7cf@events.in.gov
DESCRIPTION:Join a park naturalist for a guided hike of Trail 6 around Lak
 e Strahl! Hear about the history of the lake\, the surrounding Strahl Vall
 ey\, and learn about the animals that make it their home. The section of T
 rail 6 around Lake Strahl is considered easy to moderate. It has some shor
 t staircases\, uneven surfaces\, and wet spots. The trail is less than a m
 ile and will take about 45 minutes to complete.
LOCATION:Brown County State Park\, Lake Strahl parking lot\, 1405 S.R. 46 
 W\, Nashville\, IN 
URL:https://on.in.gov/browncountysp
X-SOURCE:Brown County State Park
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Meetup Knobstone Hiking Trail Association Of Indiana Meetup": "https://www.meetup.com/knobstone-hiking-trail-association-of-indiana-meetup/events/315885908/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:meetup_knobstone_hiking_trail_association_of_indiana_meetup
X-SOURCE:Knobstone Hiking Trail Association
UID:event_315885908@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260905T041546Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260912T093000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260912T153000
SUMMARY:2nd Weekend Work Day Trail Building
DESCRIPTION:Knobstone Hiking Trail Association of Indiana Meetup\nWould yo
 u like to spend a day in some beautiful woods with a delightful group of p
 eople building a connecting section of Indiana’s premier long distance h
 iking trail? Come join us as we continue work on the Tecumseh Trail extens
 ion portion of the KHT in MMSF. We will be building the new trail includin
 g clipping green briar.\nPlease bring a lunch and water. We will have larg
 e hand tools\, but please bring any small tools you have such as clippers 
 or a pruning saw. And a backpack is handy to carry everything in. Instruct
 ions will be provided for those who need them. We finish about 3:30.\nMeet
  at the parking lot at the base of Gose Creek Road at the end of Hinson Ro
 ad in Martinsville.\nJoin us on our website at http://www.knobstonehikingt
 rail.org/\, on Facebook at [www.facebook.com/groups/2255586117953484](http
 ://www.facebook.com/groups/2255586117953484)\, and Substack [https://khta.
 substack.com/](https://khta.substack.com/)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/knobstone-hiking-trail-association-of
 -indiana-meetup/events/315885908/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260729T064000Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260729T064000Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
