DESCRIPTION:The ISRA Cider Run is an annual automotive hobbyist event host
 ed by the Indiana Street Rod Association at the Brown County 4H Fairground
 s in Nashville\, Indiana. Since 1972\, this gathering brings together stre
 et rod and classic car enthusiasts — members and non-members alike — f
 or a day of cruising\, car displays\, camaraderie\, and community fun. Ope
 n to all makes and models\, the Cider Run offers a relaxed atmosphere to c
 onnect with fellow motorsports fans\, enjoy scenic Brown County\, and cele
 brate automotive passion each September.\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20260206
LOCATION:802 Memorial Drive\, Nashville\, IN
PRIORITY:5
TRANSP:OPAQUE
