DESCRIPTION:Whether you're a faculty member\, staff member\, postdoc\, or 
 student\, this virtual fair is your gateway to the resources that power su
 ccessful research workflows—from planning and data discovery to analysis
 \, sharing\, and compliance.Connect personally — Join a drop-in Zoom ses
 sion on Tuesday\, September 15th\, 11 AM - 1 PM ET to speak with research 
 data experts about a project\, ask questions\, and get individualized guid
 ance.Address real challenges — Discover resources tailored to your needs
 \, from managing complex datasets to preparing data sharing plans and meet
 ing funder requirements.Stay productive and efficient — All resources ar
 e curated to help you get your research done smarter and faster.  For more
  information\, visit the fair website. (https://researchdata.iu.edu/virtua
 l-resource-fair/)
