BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-ID:gcal_sanshinji_org_3q9maq1gaa99bpu6da81ibrl7g
SUMMARY:Ryaku fusatsu
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260914T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260914T201500
DTSTAMP:20260905T041606Z
UID:4kj42msl3qe1f8n30cmrf2ktae@google.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/New_York:20260914T190000
SEQUENCE:1
CREATED:20260715T170218Z
DESCRIPTION:<br><br><br><table><tbody><tr><td><br>Ryaku fusatsu is our mo
 nthly ceremony of recognizing and renewing our aspiration to embody the <
 a href="https://sanshin-source.weebly.com/precepts.html" target="_blank"><
 u>bodhisattva precepts</u></a> throughout our lives. We carry out this ce
 remony on the Monday evening closest to the 15th of each month (except Feb
  &amp\; Aug)\, beginning at 7 pm.<br><br>​All are welcome\, in-person an
 d <a href="https://www.sanshinji.org/virtual-practice.html" target="_blan
 k"><u>virtually</u></a>\, whether or not you've formally received precepts
 . </td></tr></tbody></table><br><strong><em>If attending in person\, plea
 se show up by 6:50 pm\, to allow enough time for offering incense and puri
 fying rakusu or okesa (if you have one) before the ceremony.</em></strong>
 <br><br><b><u>RF dates coming up:</u></b><br><ul><li>Sep 14</li><li>Oct 12
 </li><li>Nov 16</li><li>Dec 14</li><li>Jan 18</li><li>Mar 15</li><li>Apr 1
 2</li><li>May 17</li><li>June 14</li><li>July 12</li></ul>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260831T135622Z
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
X-SOURCE:Sanshin Zen Community
END:VEVENT
