 member\, postdoc\, or student\, this virtual fair is your gateway to the r
 esources that power successful research workflows—from planning and data
  discovery to analysis\, sharing\, and compliance.</p><p><strong>Connect p
 ersonally</strong> — Join a drop-in Zoom session on Tuesday\, September 
 15th\, 11 AM - 1 PM ET to speak with research data experts about a project
 \, ask questions\, and get individualized guidance.<br /><br /><strong>Add
 ress real challenges</strong> — Discover resources tailored to your need
 s\, from managing complex datasets to preparing data sharing plans and mee
 ting funder requirements.<br /><br /><strong>Stay productive and efficient
 </strong> — All resources are curated to help you get your research done
  smarter and faster.</p><p>  For more information\, <a href="https://resea
 rchdata.iu.edu/virtual-resource-fair/">visit the fair website.</a></p>
