DESCRIPTION:This is the Largest Exhibition of T.C. Steele’s Work in 100 
 Years! The exhibit is open to public starting at Noon on July 19th\, follo
 wed by a special presentation of “Selma and the Painter” starring Jill
  Tasker at 2:00 pm. Free admission all day and $25 Souvenir Catalogue. The
  exhibit will then be ongoing during regular operating hours through Septe
 mber 20th with free admission and free parking.\n
