CATEGORIES:Training, non-credit classes, and learning opportunities
DESCRIPTION:Join SecureMyResearch\, from the Center for Applied Cybersecur
 ity Research\, to learn more about best practices for storing and share yo
 ur sensitive data\, as well as the resources available to IU Researchers._
 _________  New to research\, new to managing your own data\, or interested
  in learning more about research data support at IU? Over the course of th
 e Fall 2026 semester\, join us for webinars designed to walk you through t
 he basics of researching with data at IU— from organizing and storing yo
 ur data to meeting funder requirements and finding the right tools.  Hoste
 d by IU Libraries\, the IU Research Data Commons\, and other campus partne
 rs\, with sessions useful for researchers at any stage. Some sessions may 
 require advanced registration.  For any questions\, please contact the IU 
 Libraries Research Data Services team (resdata@iu.edu (mailto:resdata@iu.e
 du)) - and don't forget to check back regularly\, as new sessions are adde
 d!
LAST-MODIFIED:20260811T235708Z
URL:https://events.iu.edu/libraries/event/2364497-secure-research-data-at-
 iu
