 ntrast="none">__________</span></p><p>  New to research\, new to managing 
 your own data\, or interested in learning more about research data support
  at IU? Over the course of the Fall 2026 semester\, join us for webinars d
 esigned to walk you through the basics of researching with data at IU— f
 rom organizing and storing your data to meeting funder requirements and fi
 nding the right tools.</p><p>  Hosted by IU Libraries\, the IU Research Da
 ta Commons\, and other campus partners\, with sessions useful for research
 ers at any stage. Some sessions may require advanced registration.</p><p> 
  For any questions\, please contact the IU Libraries Research Data Service
 s team (<a href="mailto:resdata@iu.edu">resdata@iu.edu</a>) - and don't fo
 rget to check back regularly\, as new sessions are added!</p>
X-LIVEWHALE-CONTACT-INFO:<p>\n  IU Libraries Research Data Services: <a hr
 ef="mailto:resdata@iu.edu">resdata@iu.edu</a>&#160\;\n</p>
