X-SOURCE-ID:events_livewhale_11
SUMMARY:Food for Thought Info Session with FAST Enterprise
DTSTART:20260915T210000Z
DTEND:20260915T220000Z
DTSTAMP:20260903T154635Z
UID:20260915T210000Z-2406430@events.iu.edu
RECURRENCE-ID:20260915T210000Z
CATEGORIES:Career development,Lectures, talks, seminars, and conferences
DESCRIPTION:Learn about the company and current opportunities for Implemen
 tation Consultants\, Tech Team members\, and Training Coordinators.  Hear 
 firsthand what skills they are looking for and how to make your resume sta
 nd out.  Recruiting for Math\, Statistics\, and Economics.  About FAST: Bu
 ild technology that improves the lives of millions of people! At FAST\, yo
 u'll help modernize government software that powers systems people rely on
  every day. Whether it's tax processing\, drivers and vehicle services\, u
 nemployment insurance\, or child support programs\, you will be improving 
 the way that governments serve their communities.  You'll work directly wi
 th clients\, solve complex business and technical challenges\, and take on
  meaningful responsibility early in your career. Instead of being one smal
 l piece of a project\, you'll participate in the full software implementat
 ion lifecycle: gathering requirements\, configuring solutions\, testing fu
 nctionality\, training users\, and supporting successful go-lives.  We loo
 k for individuals who are curious\, adaptable\, and strong communicators. 
 Because much of our work takes place alongside our clients\, employees sho
 uld be open to relocating and embracing new opportunities throughout their
  careers.
GEO:39.166203;-86.52136
LAST-MODIFIED:20260903T194635Z
LOCATION:BALLANTINE HALL
URL:https://events.iu.edu/live/events/2405079-food-for-thought-info-sessio
 n-with-fast-enterprise
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  Learn about the company and current oppo
 rtunities for Implementation Consultants\, Tech Team members\, and Trainin
 g Coordinators.</p><p>  Hear firsthand what skills they are looking for an
 d how to make your resume stand out.</p><p>  Recruiting for Math\, Statist
 ics\, and Economics.</p><p>  About FAST: Build technology that improves th
 e lives of millions of people! At FAST\, you'll help modernize government 
 software that powers systems people rely on every day. Whether it's tax pr
 ocessing\, drivers and vehicle services\, unemployment insurance\, or chil
 d support programs\, you will be improving the way that governments serve 
 their communities.<br /><br />  You'll work directly with clients\, solve 
 complex business and technical challenges\, and take on meaningful respons
 ibility early in your career. Instead of being one small piece of a projec
 t\, you'll participate in the full software implementation lifecycle: gath
 ering requirements\, configuring solutions\, testing functionality\, train
 ing users\, and supporting successful go-lives.<br /><br />  We look for i
 ndividuals who are curious\, adaptable\, and strong communicators. Because
  much of our work takes place alongside our clients\, employees should be 
 open to relocating and embracing new opportunities throughout their career
 s.</p>
X-LIVEWHALE-CONTACT-INFO:<p>Angie Zickmund\, Assistant Director\, External
  Relations</p>
X-LIVEWHALE-ID:2406430
X-LIVEWHALE-TIMEZONE:America/New_York
