CATEGORIES:Career development,Student success and career development,Train
 ing, non-credit classes, and learning opportunities
DESCRIPTION:Whether you're a faculty member\, staff member\, postdoc\, or 
 student\, this virtual fair is your gateway to the resources that power su
 ccessful research workflows—from planning and data discovery to analysis
 \, sharing\, and compliance.Connect personally — Join a drop-in Zoom ses
 sion on Tuesday\, September 15th\, 11 AM - 1 PM ET to speak with research 
 data experts about a project\, ask questions\, and get individualized guid
 ance.Address real challenges — Discover resources tailored to your needs
 \, from managing complex datasets to preparing data sharing plans and meet
 ing funder requirements.Stay productive and efficient — All resources ar
 e curated to help you get your research done smarter and faster.  For more
  information\, visit the fair website. (https://researchdata.iu.edu/virtua
 l-resource-fair/)
LAST-MODIFIED:20260825T154937Z
URL:https://events.iu.edu/live/events/2371640-iu-research-data-commons-vir
 tual-resource-fair
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  Whether you're a faculty member\, staff 
 member\, postdoc\, or student\, this virtual fair is your gateway to the r
 esources that power successful research workflows—from planning and data
  discovery to analysis\, sharing\, and compliance.</p><p><strong>Connect p
 ersonally</strong> — Join a drop-in Zoom session on Tuesday\, September 
 15th\, 11 AM - 1 PM ET to speak with research data experts about a project
 \, ask questions\, and get individualized guidance.<br /><br /><strong>Add
 ress real challenges</strong> — Discover resources tailored to your need
 s\, from managing complex datasets to preparing data sharing plans and mee
 ting funder requirements.<br /><br /><strong>Stay productive and efficient
 </strong> — All resources are curated to help you get your research done
  smarter and faster.</p><p>  For more information\, <a href="https://resea
 rchdata.iu.edu/virtual-resource-fair/">visit the fair website.</a></p>
