CATEGORIES:Student-run
DESCRIPTION:Interested in being a member of ILAP?  Attend our New Member T
 raining\, where you will learn more about our organization\, the work we d
 o\, and the necessary requirements for our new members! We will teach you 
 about different ways incarcerated individuals ask for our assistance and w
 hat you can do as a first-year law student to put your new legal skills in
 to practice.  If you are planning to be a member of ILAP\, this meeting is
  mandatory.  RSVP below by 6:00 PM on September 14 to attend. Dinner will 
 be provided to all who RSVP!
GEO:39.165074;-86.526424
LAST-MODIFIED:20260828T173037Z
LOCATION:Lowell E. Baier Hall - Lecture Room - 121
URL:https://events.iu.edu/lawiub/event/2393996-ilap-new-member-training
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  Interested in being a member of ILAP?</p
 ><p>  Attend our New Member Training\, where you will learn more about our
  organization\, the work we do\, and the necessary requirements for our ne
 w members! We will teach you about different ways incarcerated individuals
  ask for our assistance and what you can do as a first-year law student to
  put your new legal skills into practice.</p><p>  If you are planning to b
 e a member of ILAP\, this meeting is mandatory.</p><p>  RSVP below by 6:00
  PM on September 14 to attend. Dinner will be provided to all who RSVP!</p
 >
