 ity to collaborate in their organizations and communities.\nWhether you'r
 e leading a student org\, supporting a team\, or just getting started\, B
 ridgework offers practical tools and powerful insights to help you build 
 better bridges—between people\, ideas\, and action.\n📅 September 16th\, 
 2026⏰ 6:00 PM – 8:00 PM📍 IMU Club Hub\nAll Indiana University events\, g
 roups\, activities\, and educational\, cultural\, and historical observan
 ces welcome all IU students and other members of the Indiana University c
 ommunity.\n\nHosted by: Indiana Memorial Union\, Student Involvement and 
 Leadership Center\n\nAdditional Information can be found at: https://bein
 volved.indiana.edu/event/12630407
