RECURRENCE-ID:20260916T230000Z
ATTACH:https://events.iu.edu/live/image/gid/59/width/168/height/168/crop/1
 /src_region/0,0,1545,1999/31252_Nuestras_Races_1.rev.1781188543.jpg
CATEGORIES:Student-run
DESCRIPTION:Nuestras Raíces is an open mic and family-style gathering tha
 t celebrates personal traditions\, cultures\, and histories. This program 
 honors our familias\, those who came before us whose stories and memories 
 help preserve and illuminate the diverse experiences of our communities ac
 ross generations.  Join us in sharing your own stories\, mementos\, photog
 raphs\, songs\, poems\, writings\, and other meaningful pieces connected t
 o you. Together\, we create space to connect\, reflect\, and celebrate the
  roots that shape who we are.
GEO:39.168732;-86.525021
LAST-MODIFIED:20260811T153802Z
LOCATION:La Casa/Latino Cultural Center
URL:https://events.iu.edu/lacasaiub/event/2324803-nuestras-raices-we-all-h
 ave-a-story
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  Nuestras Raíces is an open mic and fami
 ly-style gathering that celebrates personal traditions\, cultures\, and hi
 stories. This program honors our <em>familias</em>\, those who came before
  us whose stories and memories help preserve and illuminate the diverse ex
 periences of our communities across generations.</p><p>  Join us in sharin
 g your own stories\, mementos\, photographs\, songs\, poems\, writings\, a
 nd other meaningful pieces connected to you. Together\, we create space to
  connect\, reflect\, and celebrate the roots that shape who we are.</p>
X-LIVEWHALE-CONTACT-INFO:<p>\n  lacasa@iu.edu\n</p>
