 tion does not sell advance tickets or vendor space for any of the Glow Wee
 k events\; admission is paid on site. </p><h3><b>Splash &amp\; Glow Party
 </b></h3><ul><li><strong><b>Admission:</b></strong> $5/person</li><li><st
 rong><b>Day: </b></strong>Thursday\, Sept. 17</li><li><strong><b>Time: <
 /b></strong>7-8:30 p.m.</li><li><address><p><a href="https://switchyardpar
 k.com/"><u>Switchyard Park</u></a><br>1601 S. Rogers St.<br>Bloomington\, 
 IN 47403</p></address></li></ul><p>Colored lights in the Community Foundat
 ion Switchyard Plaza Spray Pad\, glow sticks all around\, and a glow-in-th
 e-dark hunt for prizes kick off a "glowing" weekend!</p>
