X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Brown County Events": "https://browncounty.com/events/warn-in-the-woods/", "WFHB Community Calendar": "https://wfhb.org/events/war-in-the-woods-no-prep-drag-racing-2/"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Browncounty": "https://browncounty.com/events/warn-in-the-woods/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:browncounty
SUMMARY:War in the Woods
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260918T080000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260920T180000
DTSTAMP:20251204T100322Z
UID:MEC-af355a8a4d1e8f26d4275cde117f5446@browncounty.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260918T080000
SEQUENCE:5
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://browncounty.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/
 12/Square-Images-2.jpg
CATEGORIES:Entertainment,Happening,Outdoor Adventure,Races
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20251204
DESCRIPTION: Get ready for one of the wildest\, most adrenaline-charged d
 rag-racing events in the country — War in the Woods No Prep\, held at Br
 own County Dragway in Morgantown\, Indiana. Twice each year\, the speed-ob
 sessed and the curious come together for a full throttle weekend of no-pre
 p racing action and high-stakes competition. war-in-the-woods-no-prep.com+
 2Brown County Indiana+2\n📅 Upcoming Dates (2026):\n\n\nMay 29–31\n\n\
 nSeptember 18–20 war-in-the-woods-no-prep.com+1\n\n\n📍 Location:Brown
  County Dragway — 480 Gatesville Road\, Morgantown\, IN 46160 Brown Coun
 ty Indiana+1\nWhat to Expect:\n\n\n⚡ High-octane drag races across multi
 ple classes like Small Tire\, Big Tire\, Hard Tire\, Stick Shift\, Nitroou
 s Mayhem and more. war-in-the-woods-no-prep.com+1\n\n\n🔊 Drivers meetin
 gs\, chip draws\, and a track that goes “hot” at 3:00 p.m. both days 
 — expect action and intensity from start to finish. war-in-the-woods-no-
 prep.com+1\n\n\n🚗 A raw “no prep” setup for daring street cars\, wh
 ere traction is minimal and every run is a gamble — it’s what makes Wa
 r in the Woods the wildest in the sport. No Prep Racing+1\n\n\n🎟️ Gen
 eral admission tickets available at the gate (cash only): $25 for one-day 
 or $40 for a two-day pass. VIP packages (when available) offer perks like 
 premium parking\, food/drink vouchers\, and exclusive access. war-in-the-w
 oods-no-prep.com+1\n\n\nImportant for Spectators:\n\n\nBring a chair — s
 pectator seating is limited and mostly standing or informal. war-in-the-wo
 ods-no-prep.com+1\n\n\nNo overnight camping or motorized spectator vehicle
 s allowed — plan accordingly. war-in-the-woods-no-prep.com+1\n\n\nParkin
 g is assigned on arrival\; please follow staff directions — blocking dri
 veways or track access will result in towing. war-in-the-woods-no-prep.com
 +1\n\n\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20260526
LOCATION:480 Gatesville Road\, Morgantown\, IN 46160
PRIORITY:5
TRANSP:OPAQUE
URL:https://browncounty.com/events/warn-in-the-woods/
X-SOURCE:Brown County Events, WFHB Community Calendar
END:VEVENT
