 07/LqJMyRf_.jpg
CATEGORIES:Art Events &amp\; Exhibits,Free,Happening
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20260728
DESCRIPTION:July 24 – November 7\, 2026\nGuild Artist Exhibition and 
 Sale\n\nSummer brings fresh inspiration\, and our Guild Artists have been 
 busy creating new work to share. Discover new landscapes\, still lifes\, 
 contemporary works\, and more as you explore the Guild Galleries. Whether
  you’re an avid collector\, art enthusiast\, or simply looking for ins
 piration\, this exhibition offers a wonderful opportunity to experience th
 e creativity that continues to thrive in Brown County.\n\n\nJuly 24 – No
 vember 7\, 2026\nThe Art of Brown County – Scenes & Views\nSpecial Exhib
 ition & Sale\n\nThe Art of Brown County – Scenes & Views is a special e
 xhibition and sale that celebrates the familiar vistas\, treasured locatio
 ns\, and fresh perspectives that honor both the natural beauty and rich ar
 tistic heritage of the area.\nFind the places you love reflected in origin
 al works by the artists of the Brown County Art Guild. Every painting tel
 ls a story of Brown County & Nashville\, Indiana with color\, light and 
 texture.\n ————————————————————
 —————————–\nBrown County Art Guild – A not for prof
 it organization located in the heart of downtown Nashville\, Indiana. 
  On display throughout its galleries is a prized collection of historic p
 aintings as well as current works for sale from regional award-winning mem
 ber artists.  The Guild also offers artist demonstrations\, workshops\, 
 and a variety of events or programs throughout the year.\nVisit our websit
 e: browncountyartguild.org or call 812-9088-6185 for more information   
 \nHours: March – December\, Monday – Saturday 11am-5pm & Sundays 12-4
 pm\nWinter Hours: January & February\, Thursday – Saturday 11am-5pm & Su
 ndays 12-4pm\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20260728
LOCATION:Brown County Art Guild\, South Van Buren Street\, Nashville\, IN
ORGANIZER;CN="Brown County Art Guild":MAILTO:admin@bcartguild.org
PRIORITY:5
TRANSP:OPAQUE
URL:https://browncounty.com/events/new-exhibitions-at-the-brown-county-art
 -guild/
