DESCRIPTION:\nOur annual rock show features dozens of vendors\, a silent a
 uction\, ticketed raffle\, and live demos of knapping\, wire wrapping\, an
 d gold panning. Admission\, parking\, and kids’ activities are all free!
  \nThis year we plan to have a food truck and live music on site\, too!\n
  \n\n\nVendor Information for Brown Co Rock and Mineral Show 2026\nVendor
  Reservation (downloadable PDF): 2026 Rock Show Vendor Form​\nTo sign u
 p as a vendor\, fully complete the above form and return it by August 1\, 
 2026\, with full payment. After this date call for availability. No phone 
 reservations accepted. All product for sale must be at least 80% rock rela
 ted. Cancellations within 30 days of Show will only be allowed a refund of
  50% of the Show fees.\nFor additional information\, view the Vendor Regis
 tration form above or email bcrmc2025@yahoo.com.\n\n
