DESCRIPTION:Gaden Khachoe Shing Buddhist Monastery presents an Open House 
 (2-5pm\, guided tours through 6pm) followed by Taste of Tibet dinner at 6p
 m.\n\nAuthentic traditional Tibetan vegetarian and non-vegetarian delicaci
 es (buffet style) including momos\, Pingsha\, Alu khatsa\, and the monaste
 ry's famous hot sauce\, plus Tibetan butter tea\, all prepared by the monk
 s in monastic style.\n\nSuggested donation: $15\nRSVP requested: www.gande
 n.org\nContact: gks@ganden.org / 812-334-3456\n\nAll are welcome - please 
 feel free to bring friends and family.
