X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p><strong>No suits\, no stress — just casu
 al conversations!</strong> Join us the evening before the Fall <a href="ht
 tps://app.joinhandshake.com/career_fairs/9d502924-59b5-4a41-919b-de3087994
 111/student_preview">Career + Internship Fair</a> for a relaxed networking
  event. Wear your best IU gear and join us for snacks as you connect with 
 employers in a friendly\, low-pressure setting. Come and go as your schedu
 le allows!</p><ul><li><strong>Monday\, September 21</strong></li><li><stro
 ng>5:30 -7 p.m. at Ernie Pyle Hall\, 1st floor commons</strong></li></ul>
