CATEGORIES:Training, non-credit classes, and learning opportunities
DESCRIPTION:Instructors looking to leverage GIS research methods\, includi
 ng StoryMaps\, are invited to attend this introductory webinar on the topi
 c.__________  New to research\, new to managing your own data\, or interes
 ted in learning more about research data support at IU? Over the course of
  the Fall 2026 semester\, join us for webinars designed to walk you throug
 h the basics of researching with data at IU— from organizing and storing
  your data to meeting funder requirements and finding the right tools.  Ho
 sted by IU Libraries\, the IU Research Data Commons\, and other campus par
 tners\, with sessions useful for researchers at any stage. Some sessions m
 ay require advanced registration.  For any questions\, please contact the 
 IU Libraries Research Data Services team (resdata@iu.edu (mailto:resdata@i
 u.edu)) - and don't forget to check back regularly\, as new sessions are a
 dded!
