 ps="{&quot\;134233117&quot\;:false\,&quot\;134233118&quot\;:false\,&quot\;
 335559738&quot\;:240\,&quot\;335559739&quot\;:0}"></span></p><p><span data
 -contrast="none">__________</span></p><p>  New to research\, new to managi
 ng your own data\, or interested in learning more about research data supp
 ort at IU? Over the course of the Fall 2026 semester\, join us for webinar
 s designed to walk you through the basics of researching with data at IU
 — from organizing and storing your data to meeting funder requirements a
 nd finding the right tools.</p><p>  Hosted by IU Libraries\, the IU Resear
 ch Data Commons\, and other campus partners\, with sessions useful for res
 earchers at any stage. Some sessions may require advanced registration.</p
 ><p>  For any questions\, please contact the IU Libraries Research Data Se
 rvices team (<a href="mailto:resdata@iu.edu">resdata@iu.edu</a>) - and don
 't forget to check back regularly\, as new sessions are added!</p>
