 n="2"><table style="border-collapse: collapse\; width: 97.3422%\;" border=
 "1"><tbody><tr><td style="width: 99.9123%\;"><p style="text-align: center\
 ;"><strong><em>Outfitting IU Athletics: Hoosier Champions</em></strong></p
 ><p style="text-align: left\;">                  This exhibit showcases ob
 jects from IU's championship teams and athletes\, connecting them to histo
 ric achievements in the Big Ten and the national stage. The items featured
  in the exhibit are from the IU Athletics Sports Memorabilia Collection an
 d feature photos and videos provided by IU Athletics and Indiana Universit
 y Archives.                </p><p style="text-align: center\;"><strong>Dat
 es: November 14\, 2025 - October 2026</strong></p><strong><picture class="
 lw_image lw_image29062  lw_align_left"><source media="(max-width: 500px)" 
