X-SOURCE-ID:events_livewhale_11
SUMMARY:Fall Career + Internship Fair: College & O'Neill
DTSTART:20260922T180000Z
DTEND:20260922T220000Z
DTSTAMP:20260818T133018Z
UID:20260922T180000Z-2385091@events.iu.edu
RECURRENCE-ID:20260922T180000Z
CATEGORIES:Career development
DESCRIPTION:Whether you want to explore great internship opportunities\, f
 ind open positions for your first full-time post-grad job or make professi
 onal connections\, the career fair has something for you!    Prepare for t
 he fair:Download the Handshake App (https://careers.college.indiana.edu/ab
 out/explore-our-center/handshake/index.html) before you arrive. View parti
 cipating employers and the positions they're recruiting you for!      Meet
  with a career coach (https://careers.college.indiana.edu/career-prep-outc
 omes/career-coaching/index.html) to review your resume or practice talking
  to employers.      Dress to make a good impression – see our examples (
 https://www.pinterest.com/iuwaltercareers/career-fair-outfits/)!      When
  you arrive:You'll check in at the entrance and get a name tag. There will
  be a place to set your stuff down\, if needed.      Feeling a little nerv
 ous? We'll have career coaches on site to answer any questions and help bo
 ost your confidence.      There's more to the fair!Drop by Ernie Pyle Hall
  any weekday between 10 a.m. and 4 p.m. for tips on how to give your Hands
 hake and LinkedIn profiles a glow-up\, prep your résumé\, practice your 
 pitch\, and make a lasting impression on employers. Can't make it? Learn m
 ore about connecting with employers. (https://careers.college.indiana.edu/
 career-prep-outcomes/connect-with-employers/index.html)The night before th
 e fair\, swing by the Career Fair Kickoff: Employer Meet &amp\; Greet from
  5:30-7 p.m. on September 21. You'll be able to meet employers who will be
  attending the career fair the next day. It'll be casual\, low-pressure\, 
 and fun!          This event is Momentum eligible
GEO:39.167655;-86.523537
LAST-MODIFIED:20260818T173018Z
LOCATION:INDIANA MEMORIAL UNION (UNION BUILDING)
URL:https://events.iu.edu/live/events/2364542-fall-career-internship-fair-
 college-oneill
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<div class="sc-hgBypa fgxsNL"></div><div clas
 s="sc-eXJteL kOnyhP"><div><p>      Whether you want to explore great inter
 nship opportunities\, find open positions for your first full-time post-gr
 ad job or make professional connections\, the career fair has something fo
 r you!    </p><p><strong>Prepare for the fair:</strong></p><ul><li><a href
 ="https://careers.college.indiana.edu/about/explore-our-center/handshake/i
 ndex.html">Download the Handshake App</a> before you arrive. View particip
 ating employers and the positions they're recruiting you for!      </li><l
 i><a href="https://careers.college.indiana.edu/career-prep-outcomes/career
 -coaching/index.html">Meet with a career coach</a> to review your resume o
 r practice talking to employers.      </li><li>Dress to make a good impres
 sion – <a title="Link: https://www.pinterest.com/iuwaltercareers/career-
 fair-outfits/" href="https://www.pinterest.com/iuwaltercareers/career-fair
 -outfits/" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">see our examples</a>!  
     </li></ul><p><strong>When you arrive:</strong></p><ul><li>You'll check
  in at the entrance and get a name tag. There will be a place to set your 
 stuff down\, if needed.      </li><li>Feeling a little nervous? We'll have
  career coaches on site to answer any questions and help boost your confid
 ence.      </li></ul><p><strong>There's more to the fair!</strong></p><ul>
 <li>Drop by Ernie Pyle Hall any weekday between 10 a.m. and 4 p.m. for tip
 s on how to give your Handshake and LinkedIn profiles a glow-up\, prep you
 r résumé\, practice your pitch\, and make a lasting impression on employ
 ers. Can't make it? <a title="Link: https://careers.college.indiana.edu/ca
 reer-prep-outcomes/connect-with-employers/index.html" href="https://career
 s.college.indiana.edu/career-prep-outcomes/connect-with-employers/index.ht
 ml" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">Learn more about connecting wi
 th employers.</a></li></ul><ul><li>The night before the fair\, swing by th
 e <strong>Career Fair Kickoff: Employer Meet &amp\; Greet</strong> from 5:
 30-7 p.m. on September 21. You'll be able to meet employers who will be at
 tending the career fair the next day. It'll be casual\, low-pressure\, and
  fun!      </li></ul><br />    This event is Momentum eligible  </div></di
 v>
