DESCRIPTION:Are you a dealmaker? No matter what field of law you're intere
 sted in\, if there are agreements to hash out\, you've got to draft them a
 nd negotiate the terms. This is Transactional Law. Maurer's X-Act ("exact!
 ") Competition will teach you these skills and put them to the test. And y
 ou can win some hardware or a spot on the X-Act Transactional Team.
