DESCRIPTION:\n\n\n\n\n\n\nTest your knowledge and enjoy a fun night out at
  Trivia Night hosted weekly at Moontown Brewing Company in downtown Nashvi
 lle! Gather your friends\, grab a craft beer\, and compete in five rounds 
 of trivia covering everything from pop culture and history to music\, movi
 es\, and more. Free to play and open to teams of any size\, this lively we
 ekly event is perfect for both serious trivia buffs and casual players loo
 king for a fun midweek outing. Prizes are awarded to the top teams\, and M
 oontown’s relaxed atmosphere\, local brews\, and great food make it an i
 deal spot to unwind and connect with friends in Brown County. Trivia takes
  place Wednesdays from 6–8 PM.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20260513
ORGANIZER;CN="Moontown Brewing Co.":MAILTO:
