 t/168/crop/1/src_region/0\,0\,800\,800/32329_Sept2026SRogers_headshot_crop
 ped.rev.1788369875.png
X-LIVEWHALE-RSVP:1
X-LIVEWHALE-SUMMARY:<p>\n  Join us for FREE monthly screenings of archival
  16mm film shorts you probably haven't seen before projected on our 1950's
  Kodak film projectors!\n</p>
