X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Limestone Post": "https://guides.idsnews.com/happenings/event/animal-hour-at-wonderlab"}
X-SOURCE-ID:limestone_post
SUMMARY:Animal Hour at WonderLab
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260925T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260925T150000
UID:260819P_AwGAA_eUG9XQpRXazl3g
DESCRIPTION:date/time: Every Friday starting 07/03 and ending 09/25\, 3-4p
 m Get closer to the wild side with Animal Hour and Dive Deeper! These week
 ly programs let you chat with WonderLab's animal experts\, discover what i
 t takes to care for creatures from around the globe\, and meet snakes\, li
 zards\, insects\, arachnids\, and more-up close and out of their habitats.
  Animal Hour takes place on most Fridays\, while Dive Deeper happens on th
 e last Friday of each month at WonderLab's stunning coral reef aquarium.
LOCATION:Wonderlab
URL:https://guides.idsnews.com/happenings/event/animal-hour-at-wonderlab
X-SOURCE:Limestone Post
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Brown County State Park": "on.in.gov/browncountysp"}
X-SOURCE-ID:localist_brown_county_sp
SUMMARY:Autumn Leaves Revisited\, Brown County State Park
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260925T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260925T154500
UID:ed905fc0b14a4d838ea37efda084d727@events.in.gov
DESCRIPTION:Have you ever wondered how and why our forests change into the
 ir beautiful fall colors? This program explains just that! Join a naturali
 st as we walk through how leaves transform through the seasons and why the
 y turn into the colors we see in the fall on the microscopic level! Stick 
 around after the program for a fun coloring activity to help you recognize
  and remember what changes our green leaves into yellows\, oranges\, reds\
 , and browns.
LOCATION:Brown County State Park\, Nature Center program room\, 1405 S.R. 
 46 W\, Nashville\, IN 
URL:on.in.gov/browncountysp
X-SOURCE:Brown County State Park
END:VEVENT
