SUMMARY:Beginning Granny Square Chickens with Lindsey Alumbaugh\, Day 2
DESCRIPTION:Learn how to make a cute chicken out of only two simple crochet granny squares and a few extra stitches.  This is a beginner level class\, but anyone of any skill level is welcome.  Come knowing nothing about crochet and have a chicken by the end! \nThe workshop will take place over three Saturdays; September 19\, September 26\, & October 3\, 2026.  12-4 PM each day. \nSession 2:  Learn to make a granny square! \nHomework for Session 3: Make 2 squares over the week at home \nSee Beginning Granny Square Chickens with Lindsey Alumbaugh\, Day 1\, to register. \n\n           Download QR
