BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"The Comedy Attic": "https://www.comedyattic.com/shows/377014", "Limestone Post": "https://www.comedyattic.com/events/139156"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"The Comedy Attic": "https://www.comedyattic.com/shows/377012"}
X-SOURCE-ID:comedy_attic
SUMMARY:Erica Rhodes: Call Me Crazy Tour!
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260926T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260926T210000
UID:20260926-erica-rhodes-call-me-crazy-tour-1900
DESCRIPTION:Erica Rhodes is a comedian and actor who has appeared on Ameri
 ca’s Got Talent\, The Late Show with Stephen Colbert\, Don’t Tell Come
 dy\, ABC’s Modern Family\, HBO’s Veep\, Fox’s New Girl\, @midnight\,
  NBC's Bring the Funny\, CW’s Howie Mandel Comedy Extravaganza\, and Fox
 ’s Punchline. Erica voiced the scene-stealing character of “Dotty” i
 n the hit Netflix animation series\, A Tale Dark and Grimm and starred in 
 the ABC Digital series The Off-Season. Erica was chosen as a New Face for 
 the 2018 Just for Laughs Festival and has performed at JFL Bermuda & Vanco
 uver\, Netflix is A Joke\, Moontower Comedy Festival\, and San Francisco S
 ketchfest. Her most recent album\, Ladybug was released in 2023\, and her 
 albums\, Sad Lemon and Ladybug hit #1 on the iTunes comedy charts. Her one
 -hour comedy special\, La Vie en Rhodes was produced as part of the Tribec
 a Drive-In Fest and can now be viewed on Amazon Prime. Her Dry Bar special
 \, Love You More\, has more than 2 million views on YouTube and can also b
 e viewed on Amazon. Sofia Vergara proclaimed Rhodes "The best comedy act s
 he has ever seen on AGT."  Bring the Funny judge Jeff Foxworthy described
  Erica as “The best-defined comic voice of the competition.” Erica sem
 i-regular performer/writer on NPR’s A Prairie Home Companion\, and recur
 red on the Audible series\, Dr. Katz: The Audiobook.
LOCATION:The Comedy Attic\, 123 S Walnut Street\, Bloomington\, IN
URL:https://www.comedyattic.com/shows/377012
X-SOURCE:The Comedy Attic, Limestone Post
END:VEVENT
