DESCRIPTION:Harvest Festival at Hard Truth Distilling Co.\nCelebrate the s
 eason at the Harvest Festival\, a fall tradition filled with live entertai
 nment\, handcrafted experiences\, and unforgettable flavors. Set against t
 he backdrop of Brown County in autumn\, this all-ages event brings togethe
 r the best of the season for a day of fun\, discovery\, and community.\nEn
 joy:\n\nDark Roast Rye Whiskey Release\nWhiskey Tastings\nLive Music Throu
 ghout the Day\nVendor Market Featuring Local Makers & Artisans\nCigar Loun
 ge\nFall-Inspired Cocktails\nSeasonal Food & Beverage Offerings\nFamily-Fr
 iendly Fall Activities\nGames & Interactive Experiences\nScenic Autumn Vie
 ws\n\nWhether you’re a whiskey enthusiast\, music lover\, cigar aficiona
 do\, or simply looking for a memorable fall outing with family and friends
 \, Harvest Festival offers something for everyone. Spend the day exploring
  local vendors\, enjoying great live music\, sampling seasonal cocktails a
 nd whiskey\, and celebrating everything that makes autumn in Brown County 
 special.\nJoin us for a day filled with great whiskey\, live entertainment
 \, fall traditions\, and the spirit of the harvest.\n
