X-LIVEWHALE-ONLINE-URL:https://iu.zoom.us/j/87111484380
X-LIVEWHALE-SUMMARY:<p>\n  The Ostrom Workshop Colloquium Series welcomes 
 Dr. Vaishnavi Tripuraneni<br />\n  (University of Delaware\, Department of
  Geography and Spatial Sciences).\n</p>
