SUMMARY:Retail & Fine Arts Career Fair Prep: Resume Drop-In
DTSTART:20260928T180000Z
DTEND:20260928T200000Z
DTSTAMP:20260818T133011Z
UID:20260928T180000Z-2385089@events.iu.edu
RECURRENCE-ID:20260928T180000Z
CATEGORIES:Career development
DESCRIPTION:Career fair season is here! Is your resume ready to share with
  employers? Stop by Kirkwood Hall for a Career Fair Resume Drop-In for qui
 ck\, personalized feedback before meeting with recruiters. A career coach 
 will help you strengthen your resumes\, highlight your most relevant exper
 iences\, and make last-minute improvements so you can attend the fair with
  confidence.&#160\;Who should attend:&#160\;  Students from any major who 
 plan to attend the Retail Career Fair and/or the Fine Arts Career Fair tha
 t would like brief resume feedback before connecting with employers.&#160\
 ;  No appointment is required. Bring a printed or digital copy of your res
 ume.&#160\;  Can't make it? Attend the other Career Fair Prep: Resume Drop
 -In (https://events.iu.edu/iuwalter/event/2380053-retail-and-fine-arts-car
 eer-fair-prep-resume) on Tuesday\, September 29&#160\;or stop by Ernie Pyl
 e Hall for drop-in coaching (https://careers.college.indiana.edu/about/exp
 lore-our-center/drop-in-coaching/index.html) from 10am-4pm any weekday dur
 ing the school year.&#160\;  This event is Momentum eligible.
GEO:39.165971;-86.523584
LAST-MODIFIED:20260818T173011Z
LOCATION:KIRKWOOD HALL
URL:https://events.iu.edu/live/events/2380051-retail-fine-arts-career-fair
 -prep-resume
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  Career fair season is here! Is your resu
 me ready to share with employers? Stop by Kirkwood Hall for a <strong>Care
 er Fair Resume Drop-In</strong> for quick\, personalized feedback before m
 eeting with recruiters. A career coach will help you strengthen your resum
 es\, highlight your most relevant experiences\, and make last-minute impro
 vements so you can attend the fair with confidence.&#160\;</p><p><strong>W
 ho should attend:&#160\;</strong><br />  Students from any major who plan 
 to attend the Retail Career Fair and/or the Fine Arts Career Fair that wou
 ld like brief resume feedback before connecting with employers.&#160\;</p>
 <p>  No appointment is required. Bring a printed or digital copy of your r
 esume.&#160\;</p><p>  Can't make it? Attend the other <strong><a href="htt
 ps://events.iu.edu/iuwalter/event/2380053-retail-and-fine-arts-career-fair
 -prep-resume">Career Fair Prep: Resume Drop-In</a> on Tuesday\, September 
 29</strong>&#160\;or stop by Ernie Pyle Hall for <a href="https://careers.
 college.indiana.edu/about/explore-our-center/drop-in-coaching/index.html">
 drop-in coaching</a> from 10am-4pm any weekday during the school year.&#16
 0\;</p><p>  This event is Momentum eligible.</p>
