X-SOURCE-ID:browncounty
SUMMARY:The Carpenters Songbook: A Live Celebration
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261001T233000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261001T233000
DTSTAMP:20260625T151951Z
UID:MEC-dbc970280aedf26d2f5b564f04e44d1a@browncounty.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261001T233000
SEQUENCE:2
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://browncounty.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/
 06/2-scaled.jpeg
CATEGORIES:Entertainment,Happening,Live Music
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20260625
DESCRIPTION:Few voices in pop history are as instantly recognizable\, or a
 s deeply loved\, as Karen Carpenter’s. The Carpenters Songbook: A Live C
 elebration brings the icon’s extraordinary voice and the brother-sister 
 duo’s unforgettable music back to the stage in a beautifully crafted all
 -new production from the creative team behind The Simon & Garfunkel Story.
  With a full band and heartfelt storytelling\, this concert captures the w
 armth\, emotion\, and musical brilliance of The Carpenters. It’s a touch
 ing tribute that invites audiences to sing-along\, reminisce\, and fall in
  love all over again. Expect to relive all of their favorites including 
 “We’ve Only Just Begun\,” “Close to You\,” and “Rainy Days and
  Mondays” with this heartfelt love letter to the quiet magic of Karen an
 d Richard Carpenter.\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20260630
LOCATION:200 Maple Leaf Boulevard\, Nashville\, IN 47448
PRIORITY:5
TRANSP:OPAQUE
URL:https://browncounty.com/events/the-carpenters-songbook-a-live-celebrat
 ion/
