ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://browncounty.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/
 09/Untitled-design-57.jpg
CATEGORIES:Art Events &amp\; Exhibits,Classes &amp\; Workshops,Family Frie
 ndly,Happening,Outdoor Adventure,Special Events
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20250908
DESCRIPTION:Immerse yourself in the beauty of fall at Waycross during our 
 Fall Nature Journaling Retreat. The vibrant colors of the changing seasons
  will provide the perfect backdrop for deep observation and creativity. Th
 is weekend retreat will offer a peaceful space to connect with the natural
  world\, using art and journaling as tools to deepen your awareness of nat
 ure in the season of fall. Guided prompts\, outdoor sketching sessions\, a
 nd time spent exploring the colorful fall foliage will foster a deeper con
 nection with nature and creation.\n\n\nOctober 2-4\, 2026\n\n\nCheck-in: 4
 -6pm\n\n\nCheck-out: 10am\n\n\n\n\nAll ages welcome\, minors must be accom
 panied by an adult.\n\n\nProgram Rates\n\n\nAttendance cost is calculated 
 during online registration\, depending on your lodging selection. Rates ar
 e per person and include program fees\, lodging and meals.\n\n\nConference
  Center – Single Occupancy: $350 per person\n\n\nConference Center – D
 ouble Occupancy: $280 per person\n\n\nYouth (10-17): $150 per person\n\n\n
 Children (4-9): $110 per person\n\n\n3 and under: $0\n\n\n\n\n\n\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20260319
LOCATION:4879 Richards Rd\, Morgantown\, IN
PRIORITY:5
TRANSP:OPAQUE
