  PM</strong><br /><strong>Shreve Auditorium</strong><br />  Global and Int
 ernational Studies Building<br />  355 N. Eagleson Ave.\, Bloomington</p><
 p><strong>How did Taiwan build a semiconductor industry from scratchand tr
 ansform it into a global technological force?</strong></p><p>  Directed by
  <strong>Chu-chen Hsiao</strong>\, <em>A Chip Odyssey</em> tells the story
  of Taiwan's semiconductor industry through interviews with more than 80 p
