DESCRIPTION:Like Running or Walking? Love Wine? This race is for you! \n\n
 Join us on Sunday\, October 4\, 2026 at 10:00am for an exciting event that
  features the Owen Valley Winery! This winery prides themselves in artisti
 cally creating a wine centric culinary experience\, heavily rooted in the 
 complete production cycle of all the products we produce. Whether you are 
 looking to run\, walk or just enjoy the wine this race is a sure thing for
  a great time and an incredible experience! This race is timed and scored 
 by J3 Timing. Results will be posted at www.J3Timing.com.
LOCATION:Owen Valley Winery
