X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Events Livewhale 221": "https://events.iu.edu/bfca/event/2401711-the-flying-ace-richard-e-norman-1926-centennial"}
X-SOURCE-ID:events_livewhale_221
SUMMARY:The Flying Ace (Richard E. Norman\, 1926) Centennial Screening
DTSTART:20261007T230000Z
DTEND:20261008T000000Z
DTSTAMP:20260830T220519Z
UID:20261007T230000Z-2401711@events.iu.edu
RECURRENCE-ID:20261007T230000Z
ATTACH:https://events.iu.edu/live/image/gid/221/width/168/height/168/crop/
 1/src_region/0,0,1000,784/32272_The_Flying_Ace.rev.1788141800.jpg
CATEGORIES:Art and museum exhibitions,Culture and languages,Functions, fes
 tivals, and celebrations,Lectures, talks, seminars, and conferences,Perfor
 mances, shows, and films
DESCRIPTION:This exciting silent film includes a robbery investigation\, l
 ove story\, and Black pilots before they were legally allowed to earn lice
 nses to fly in the United States! Our programming honors actor and stuntma
 n\, Steve "Peg" Reynolds\, who had one leg.  On Wednesday\, October 7th\, 
 we'll host a pre-screening reception at the BFCA at 5:00 p.m.\, where The 
 Richard E. Norman Collection (https://nam12.safelinks.protection.outlook.c
 om/?url=https:%2F%2Fus.list-manage.com%2FlJhQwE1EbcE%3Fe%3Daae39a2b17%26c2
 id%3Ddfc0ca262765e474fd1a5227622ddfb0&amp\;data=05%7C02%7Cbfca%40iu.edu%7C
 c505c54d174a42be817a08deffcb84e5%7C1113be34aed14d00ab4bcdd02510be91%7C1%7C
 0%7C639229446766139713%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlY
 iOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7
 C%7C&amp\;sdata=RxF3xHCUDmtRUQ4pMtMtctxx8MaRuNJr7cffDizWrTY%3D&amp\;reserv
 ed=0) will be on display. Immediately following the 7:00 p.m. screening of
  The Flying Ace at IU Cinema\, Dr. Novotny Lawrence will moderate a discus
