 itor\, and Associate Editor since 2016.</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot
 \;335559685&quot\;:0}"></span></p><p><span data-contrast="none">His creati
 ve work has been exhibited at venues including the Tallinn Architecture Bi
 ennale\, Contemporary Austin\, SITE Santa Fe\, and Fusebox Festival\, and 
