X-SOURCE-URLS:{"The Comedy Attic": "https://www.comedyattic.com/shows/376663", "Limestone Post": "https://www.comedyattic.com/events/138998"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"The Comedy Attic": "https://www.comedyattic.com/shows/376662"}
X-SOURCE-ID:comedy_attic
SUMMARY:Chloe Radcliffe Returns to The Comedy Attic
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261016T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261016T210000
UID:20261016-chloe-radcliffe-returns-to-the-comedy-at-1900
DESCRIPTION:Hailing from the Midwest and proud of it\, standup and actor C
 hloe Radcliffe can be seen in Bradley Cooper’s latest film Is This Thing
  On? She was named a Just For Laughs 2025 New Face \, along with one of De
 adline’s 15 Comedians Ready To Break Out In 2025 \, and one of Vulture
 ’s Comedians You Should And Will Know . So…get to knowin’ her\, for 
 chrissakes! A daredevil cyclist in NYC\, Chloe hosts In Tandem with Chloe 
 Radcliffe \, where she interviews other comedians while they ride a tandem
  bike together. Think Comedians in Cars\, but sweatier. Chloe’s one-woma
 n show CHEAT \, about her history of infidelity\, led The New York Times
 ’ recommendations for the New York Comedy Festival. She sold out her fu
 ll-month run at the 2023 Edinburgh Fringe Festival\, with reviews calling 
 it\, “Hilarious and sharply-crafted” (Deadline)\, “Worthy of the gre
 ats like Mike Birbiglia” (Chortle)\, and “A new take on an old topic\,
  with hard-hitting punchlines” (The New York Times). Chloe is currently 
 developing CHEAT for tv. Chloe starred in Steven Soderbergh’s COMMAND Z 
 \, and was nominated for a 2024 WGA award for her writing on the series. S
 he has been seen on Comedy Central \, Don’t Tell Comedy \, and After Mid
 night with Taylor Tomlinson . She was a staff writer on The Tonight Show 
 with Jimmy Fallon \, has a comedy feature in development with Sony\, and 
 was named a TBS Comic To Watch at the New York Comedy Festival.
LOCATION:The Comedy Attic\, 123 S Walnut Street\, Bloomington\, IN
URL:https://www.comedyattic.com/shows/376662
X-SOURCE:The Comedy Attic, Limestone Post
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Browncountyplayhouse": "https://browncountyplayhouse.org/event/mamma-mania-abba-2026/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:browncountyplayhouse
X-SOURCE:Brown County Playhouse
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261016T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261016T213000
DTSTAMP:20260721T020444Z
CREATED:20260505T204823Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260721T020444Z
UID:10001455-1792179000-1792186200@browncountyplayhouse.org
SUMMARY:Mamma Mania! - The American Tribute To ABBA
DESCRIPTION:Prepare to be transported back to the vibrant 1970s with 2025’s #1 booked ABBA Tribute! Mamma Mania! brings the classic hits of one of pop music’s most iconic groups to life. With their dazzling costumes\, flawless harmonies\, and captivating stage presence\, this tribute captures the essence of ABBA’s unforgettable sound. \nFrom “Dancing Queen” to “Mamma Mia\,” fans will enjoy a night filled with nostalgia from a stellar cast of musicians! Performers include current or former touring members of: Mamma Mia – Official North American Tour\, Marc Martel’s Queen Extravaganza\, INXS\, Britney Spears\, Rob Thomas\, The Weeknd\, and many more! Mamma Mania! pays homage to ABBA’s legacy\, celebrating the timeless melodies and uplifting lyrics that have charmed listeners for generations. \nJoin us for an evening of music that showcases not only the incredible songs but also the joyful spirit of ABBA. Whether you’re a lifelong fan or new to their music\, this tribute promises to be an unforgettable experience filled with energy\, enthusiasm\, and plenty of dancing. Don’t miss your chance to be part of this extraordinary celebration of ABBA from some of New York’s finest!! \n  \nBUY TICKETS\n\n  \n\n  \nBUY TICKETS
URL:https://browncountyplayhouse.org/event/mamma-mania-abba-2026/
LOCATION:Brown County Playhouse\, 70 S. Van Buren St\, Nashville\, IN\, 47448\, United States
CATEGORIES:Live Shows,Music,Pop Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://browncountyplayhouse.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/2026-ABBA_web_event-1.jpg
END:VEVENT
