UID:302u2qudlnph7jr2otdkasgohh@google.com__20261018
SEQUENCE:0
CREATED:20260130T164919Z
DESCRIPTION:Route: TBD<br>Host: TBD<br><br>Meet at the spray pad area at S
 witchyard Park for a 1:00pm departure.<br><br>Nice 'n' Easy rides cater to
  those who want to take it easy and to less experienced riders.  These Su
 nday rides feature lower mileage (19-24 miles) and slower paces than Satur
 day touring rides.  They use Bloomington area low traffic roads.<br><br>N
