DESCRIPTION:<u></u>If no ride is listed\, then riders should feel free to 
 choose a suitable route.<br><br><span>This group emphasizes earlier\, mode
 rate-paced rides with routes planned in advance and posted on the ride cal
 endar. This is a no drop ride\, but not a beginner's ride.  Expect an ove
 rall average moving speed of 12 - 15 mph.  Distances vary from 20 to a li
 ttle over 30 miles.  Early season rides will be at the lower end of the d
 istance scale.  During colder weather the ride departs at 1:00pm.  </sp
 an><br><br>Non-members should sign up for a <a href="https://www.blooming
 tonbicycleclub.org/services-3">free trial membership</a>\,  which includ
 es signing a liability waiver\, prior to participation.<br><br><br><u></u
 >
