  width="610" height="407" data-alt="" data-caption="An away football jerse
 y worn by quarterback Harry Gonso during IU's 1967 Rose Bowl season\, left
 \, and Bob Ravensburg's 1945 leather football helmet are among the items o
 n display in the Outfitting IU Athletics exhibition in the McCalla School 
