DTSTART:20261021T233000Z
DTEND:20261022T003000Z
LOCATION:AUDITORIUM
GEO:39.168443;-86.517858
SUMMARY:Dennis James Hosts Halloween
DESCRIPTION:Bloomington's favorite musical mastermind is back for his ann
 ual spooky spectacular. Dennis James returns to the IU Auditorium pipe or
 gan for a spine-tingling Halloween tradition that blends vintage thrills 
 with live musical artistry.  &#160\;  The evening will begin with a live 
 radio-style re-enactment of the Inner Sanctum mystery "The Vengeful Corps
 e\," drawing audiences into a chilling tale of suspense straight from the
  golden age of radio and starring student actors from IU's Department of 
 Theatre and Drama.  &#160\;  James will then perform solo as he provides 
 his signature live organ accompaniment to two silent film comedy classics
 : Laurel &amp\; Hardy's eerie (and hilarious) Habeas Corpus and Buster Ke
 aton's clever caper The Haunted House. Equal parts spooky and spirited\, 
 this Halloween favorite delivers laughter\, nostalgia\, and just the righ
 t amount of fright.
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  Bloomington's favorite musical mastermi
 nd is back for his annual spooky spectacular. Dennis James returns to the
  IU Auditorium pipe organ for a spine-tingling Halloween tradition that b
 lends vintage thrills with live musical artistry.</p><p>  &#160\;</p><p> 
  The evening will begin with a live radio-style re-enactment of the <i>In
 ner Sanctum</i> mystery "The Vengeful Corpse\," drawing audiences into a 
 chilling tale of suspense straight from the golden age of radio and starr
 ing student actors from IU's Department of Theatre and Drama.</p><p>  &#1
 60\;</p><p>  James will then perform solo as he provides his signature li
 ve organ accompaniment to two silent film comedy classics: Laurel &amp\; 
 Hardy's eerie (and hilarious) <i>Habeas Corpus</i> and Buster Keaton's cl
 ever caper <i>The Haunted House</i>. Equal parts spooky and spirited\, th
 is Halloween favorite delivers laughter\, nostalgia\, and just the right 
 amount of fright.</p>
