DESCRIPTION:During prohibition\, moonshine was bootlegged out of Story suc
 h that Sheriff Clarence Moore captured the notorious still on site.  As t
 he story goes\, half of the ‘evidence’ went missing.  Story still cel
 ebrates the fermentation process by hosting public events.\nEnjoy local cr
 aft bourbon\, live music & entertainment\, with arts\, crafts\, and food v
 endors Saturday October 24\, 2026.\nLeave the children at home for this ag
 e 21+ event.\n
