X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Limestone Post": "https://www.zeffy.com/en-US/ticketing/a-harvest-of-voices--2026"}
X-SOURCE-ID:limestone_post
SUMMARY:A Harvest of Voices
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261025T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261025T180000
UID:2608176RKL81yJRkarZ_xkipUXiQ
DESCRIPTION:**A Harvest of Voices 2026** \n\nJoin us to celebrate the wor
 ds and voices of writers from Women Writing for (a) Change Bloomington cir
 cles. The event features acclaimed author **Jacinda Townsend**\, whose awa
 rd-winning work includes *Mother Country* and *Trigger Warning*. In additi
 on\, we'll lift up the voices of writers from our in-house and outreach cr
 eative writing circles.\n\nMeet Jacinda and our readers while enjoying com
 munity at a reception following the program. Please gather with us at the 
 UU Church of Bloomington to bring in our 2026 Harvest of Voices!\n\nThe mi
 ssion of Women Writing for (a) Change Bloomington is to create safe and in
 spiring learning opportunities for individuals who wish to pursue the art 
 of writing as a tool for growth and change. We believe in the power of wri
 ting to connect people to the deeper parts of themselves and to one anothe
 r. We believe that creative and conscious communities hold the key to posi
 tive transformation in our world. We provide an attentive setting in which
  every voice is honored\, nurtured\, and celebrated. Thank you for support
 ing our work
LOCATION:UU Church of Bloomington
URL:https://www.zeffy.com/en-US/ticketing/a-harvest-of-voices--2026
X-SOURCE:Limestone Post
END:VEVENT
