 taff from IU Career Centers and campus offices will serve as mock employe
 rs\, giving you the chance to practice introductions\, ask questions\, an
 d learn strategies for making the most of a career fair.</p><p>  You'll l
 eave with practical tips\, greater confidence\, and a better idea of what
  to expect when attending a real career fair.</p><p>  This is a drop-in\,
  in-person event\, so come by whenever it works for your schedule!</p>
