SUMMARY:St. Agnes Christmas & Craft Bazaar
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261106T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261106T150000
DTSTAMP:20260821T155250Z
UID:MEC-256453aba9d9c5815733df6cd9935321@browncounty.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261106T090000
SEQUENCE:4
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://browncounty.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/
 08/St-Agnes-Winter-1.jpg
CATEGORIES:Art Events &amp\; Exhibits,Family Friendly,Free,Holiday
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20260821
DESCRIPTION:The St. Agnes Christmas & Craft Bazaar is an annual event held
  the first Friday and Saturday in November. We begin the weekend with 8:00
  am Mass on Friday – everyone is welcome! Bazaar hours are Friday from 9
 :00 a.m. to 5:00 p.m. and Saturday from 9:00 a.m. to 3:00 p.m.\nThe bazaar
  is held at St. Agnes Parish Hall\, LOWER LEVEL\, 1008 McLary Road\, Nashv
 ille\, IN.  Admission and parking are free\, and it is elevator accessibl
 e.\nSelect from handcrafted Christmas decorations and gifts\, handmade wre
 aths\, home baked goods\, paper and wood crafts\, and decorated tabletop C
 hristmas trees. There is also a silent auction with themed gift baskets an
 d a handmade quilt raffle.\nProceeds from this year’s Bazaar will benefi
 t Habitat for Humanity\, Mother’s Cupboard and St. Vincent de Paul of Br
 own County.\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20260821
LOCATION:St. Agnes Catholic Church\, McLary Road\, Nashville\, IN
ORGANIZER;CN="St. Agnes Ladies Guild":MAILTO:
PRIORITY:5
TRANSP:OPAQUE
URL:https://browncounty.com/events/st-agnes-christmas-craft-bazaar/
X-SOURCE:Brown County Events
END:VEVENT
