DESCRIPTION:Welcome to WOE’s 2nd Indianapolis event —prepare yourself 
 for an experience like no other!\n \n🗓️ Saturday & Sunday\, November 
 7th & 8th\n📍 Indiana State Fairgrounds & Event Center\n🦇 Ag/Hort Bui
 lding\n🎟️ VIP 10am-7pm\n🎟️ General Admission 11am-7pm\nChildren 
 12 and under are free!\n \n👁🎪Welcome to the World Oddities Expo- a t
 raveling celebration of all things weird\, intriguing\, and magically maca
 bre! We’re combining our love of art\, history\, science and entertainme
 nt wrapped into one incredible event! Shop till you drop from dozens of ec
 lectic vendors and small businesses. Grab a ticket to the Deformed Exhibit
  to indulge in rare\, preserved specimens that defy the laws of nature! Ta
 ke a workshop in WOE labs and try your hand at taxidermy\, rat skeleton ar
 ticulation\, or create a miniature diorama terrarium and more! Visit our M
 ain Stage for amazing live performances throughout the day\, as well as su
 rprise guest speakers for free seminars! Whether you’re into oddities\, 
 art\, fashion\, science\, or the culture- this is your space to celebrate 
 what makes you unique! \n\n💀👻DEFORMED EXHIBIT\nVisit our touring\, o
 ne-of-a-kind Deformed Exhibit featuring real\, rare specimens with medical
  anomalies! Snag a combo general admission ticket or a combo VIP ticket fo
 r those who want early access to shop before the crowds.\n\n🦋🔬WOE LA
 BS\nReady to kickstart your new favorite hobby but aren’t quite sure how
  to start? Take a class at WOE Labs and enter a world where learning and c
 reativity collide! Our knowledgeable and experienced instructors are there
  to guide you step by step. Don’t stress- all experience levels are welc
 omed! Classes vary from city to city.\n\n✨️🎭 LIVE ENTERTAINMENT \nW
 e curate only the best and most talented performers to take the WOE stage!
  You’ll find everything from contortion\, odes to sideshow\, clowns\, as
  well as a few things you’ve never seen before! Don't miss these jaw dro
 pping performances at the WOE Main Stage throughout the day!\n\n✍️🩸
  ODDITY INK PARLOUR- Only in select cities* Grab some new ink at the Oddit
 y Ink Parlour and get a tattoo on site! Sponsored by Villain Arts and only
  in select cities- we’re bringing you talented artists from all over the
  country. Grab those VIP tickets so you can be first in line for an appoin
 tment! \nThis isn’t just an expo\; it’s an experience\, and you’re p
 art of it. Get ready to join a community of people who celebrate the stran
 ge\, the wonderful\, and the weird. We can’t wait to see you there—sta
 y weird\, friend!\n\n🎟️ ➡️ Get your tickets NOW at WORLDODDITIESE
 XPO.COM\n\n\n\n\n\n\nhttps://www.facebook.com/events/2006418706819661/
LAST-MODIFIED:20260306T130000Z
LOCATION:Indiana State Fairgrounds & Event Center
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
