 ;:16777215\,&quot\;335559740&quot\;:288}"></span></p><p><i><span data-cont
 rast="auto">Micro-Mythologies: World Mythology Made Miniature </span></i><
 span data-contrast="auto">is curated by Curatorial Assistant Jake Gentry\,
