DESCRIPTION:Benefit dinner supporting blind Navy veteran Lonnie Bedwell's 
 final leg of his Explorers Grand Slam\, a trip to the North Pole. Proceeds
  help complete "Beyond Vision\," a feature documentary chronicling his jou
 rney from losing his sight in 1997 to summiting all Seven Summits. Include
 s cocktails\, dinner\, a filmmaker panel\, a silent auction\, and an exclu
 sive first look at scenes from the film.\n\nMore info: https://www.commong
 roundfilms.org/gobeyond
LAST-MODIFIED:20260821T150522Z
LOCATION:Woolery Mill\, 2250 W Sunstone Dr\, Bloomington\, IN 47403
