DESCRIPTION:Tickets for the 2026 Chocolate Walk will go on sale online on 
 August 15th. \n$30 per ticket through September 30th. Price increases to 
 $35 on October 1st if any remain.\nStroll through the beautiful town of Na
 shville as you sample chocolate-themed treats from nearly 40 local shops
  and restaurants. You can even do a little early holiday shopping along t
 he way!\nCome alone\, or with a friend\, or invite a group of friends and 
 make a weekend out of it. Some friends and families make it a yearly event
 ! Whatever you do\, it’s guilt-free pleasure because all of the money su
 pports the homeless pets of Brown County!\n
