 y Bird Registration: $60.00 (Before October 1\, 2026)<br />  Standard Regi
 stration: $80.00 (October 1 - November 15\, 2026)</p><p>  &#160\;</p><p><s
 trong>2026 Keynote Speakers:</strong></p><p>  Aluki Kotierk</p><p>  Armand
 o Muyolema</p><p>  Diego A. Titueña Matango</p><p>  Teresa L. McCarty</p>
