DESCRIPTION:EJHS Art Club will host its first meeting of the year on Thurs
 day\, Aug. 27th\, after school until 3:30. Make sure to have your ride pic
 k you up at the front door #1. Meetings will be every Thursday in the art 
 room\, room 216\, unless announced. All EJHS students are invited to come 
 at any point this school year.1) Students should join the club's Google Cl
 assroom with the code awn22v2 or using the online link.https://classroom.g
 oogle.com/c/Mjg5ODM1MzUy?cjc=awn22v22) Parents/guardians and students can
  also join EJHS Art Club 2026-27 on SportsYou with the code 4XKY-6WQC
  to get text reminders.Download the app here: https://sportsyou.app
