 y Library collections: <em><a href="https://libraries.indiana.edu/lilly-li
 brary/declaration-independence" target="_blank" rel="noopener">The Declara
 tion of Independence: The Motives\, the Moment</a></em> and <em><a href="h
 ttps://libraries.indiana.edu/lilly-library/the-signers" target="_blank" re
 l="noopener">The Signers</a></em>. Additional hands-on time with rotating 
 selections from the collections will follow. These selections include medi
 eval manuscripts\, artists books\, and one of the John Ford's Best Directo
 r Oscars. Non-flash photography is permitted\, seating is available throug
 hout the tour\, and the building is wheelchair accessible. The tour genera
 lly lasts a little less than one hour and is open to all.</p>
