DESCRIPTION:This deadline reminder is for staff and commissioner reference
 . <br><br>Transportation Commission liaisons create a folder repository f
 or each agenda item on an internal shared drive. Once those documents have
  been evaluated for completeness and accessibility compliance\, they are m
 oved to a public document repository for distribution and storage. For inq
 uiries\, contact staff liaisons at <a href="mailto:transportation.commissi
 on@bloomington.in.gov">transportation.commission@bloomington.in.gov</a>. 
 <br><br><a href="https://docs.google.com/document/d/1TUUeocxRDhseTU62rGCN-
