ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://browncounty.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/
 07/The-Amazing-Dennis-Experience.jpg
CATEGORIES:Entertainment,Family Friendly,Happening,Theatre &amp\; Entertai
 nment
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20260515
DESCRIPTION:\nNashville’s INDIANA’S 16-Seat Comedy Magic Experience!\n
 \nLaugh\, be amazed\, and have an unforgettable night at Denny’s Magic S
 howroom — one of the top things to do in Nashville\, Indiana.\n\nInterac
