SUMMARY:Embedded Counseling (CAPS)
DTSTART:20261130T120000Z
DTEND:20261130T210000Z
DTSTAMP:20260810T143143Z
UID:20260914T120000Z-2376535@events.iu.edu__20261130
DESCRIPTION:Supporting your well-being is an important part of our work at
  the LGBTQ+ Culture Center. That's why we are proud to partner with Counse
 ling &amp\; Psychological Services (CAPS) to provide an embedded counselor
  in our space every Monday from 8:00 a.m. to 5:00 p.m.  Mollibeth Penner\,
  LHMCA serves as our embedded counselor and works directly with students c
 onnected to the LGBTQ+ Culture Center. To schedule an appointment\, please
  call CAPS (https://healthcenter.indiana.edu/make-appointment/index.html) 
 and let them know you are an LGBTQ+ Culture Center student interested in m
 eeting with Mollibeth at the center.      We hope this partnership makes i
 t easier for you to access support in a space where you feel comfortable a
 nd affirmed.  All Indiana University events\, groups\, activities\, educat
 ional\, cultural\, and historical observances welcome all members of the I
 ndiana University community.
GEO:39.168722;-86.525274
LAST-MODIFIED:20260810T185024Z
LOCATION:LGBTQ+ CULTURE CENTER
URL:https://events.iu.edu/lgbtq/event/2376535-embedded-counseling
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<div><p>    Supporting your well-being is an 
 important part of our work at the LGBTQ+ Culture Center. That's why we are
  proud to partner with Counseling &amp\; Psychological Services (CAPS) to 
 provide an embedded counselor in our space every Monday from 8:00 a.m. to 
 5:00 p.m.  </p><p><strong>Mollibeth Penner\, LHMCA</strong> serves as our 
 embedded counselor and works directly with students connected to the LGBTQ
 + Culture Center. To schedule an appointment\, please <a class="fui-Link f
 ai-bebop ___1v1lyro f2hkw1w f3rmtva f1ewtqcl f16muhyy f1k6fduh f1w7gpdv f1
 mo0ibp fjoy568 ff5ikls f1s184ao f1mk8lai fnbmjn9 f1o700av f13mvf36 f33ey8m
  f9n3di6 f1ids18y f1tx3yz7 feiuef2 f1eh06m1 f54796x fhgqx19 f1olyrje f1p93
 eir f1nev41a f132whgj f1v74mp6 f1tsf1ni fnq52rx f16zlvvm" tabindex="0" hre
 f="https://healthcenter.indiana.edu/make-appointment/index.html" target="_
 blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-tabster="{&quot\;restorer&quot\;:{&q
 uot\;type&quot\;:1}}">call CAPS</a> and let them know you are an LGBTQ+ Cu
 lture Center student interested in meeting with Mollibeth at the center.  
 </p><p>    We hope this partnership makes it easier for you to access supp
 ort in a space where you feel comfortable and affirmed.  </p><p><strong>Al
 l Indiana University events\, groups\, activities\, educational\, cultural
 \, and historical observances welcome all members of the Indiana Universit
 y community.</strong></p></div>
