DESCRIPTION:This event will be an opportunity for individuals to get toget
 her with their tarot decks and practice divination! We are seeking to grow
  alongside other women and non-binary practitioners who read tarot. This g
 roup is meant to help trade knowledge\, pull cards together\, and even sha
 re tarot decks if desired. No prior knowledge of tarot is necessary to att
 end\, and decks will be provided (to borrow) at meetings for those who do 
