SUMMARY:Shucked
DESCRIPTION:The Tony Award-winning musical comedy Shucked makes its IU Au
 ditorium debut in 2027.  &#160\;  Maizy and Beau are getting hitched\, wh
 en the corn that protects their small community starts to die. The town n
 eeds answers. But who will dare venture beyond the borders of Cob County?
   &#160\;  Including the knockout songs "Woman of the World\," "Somebody 
 Will\," and "Independently Owned\," this Broadway hit about an unlikely h
 ero\, an unscrupulous con artist\, and a battle for the heart and soil of
  a small town\, is not to be missed.
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  The Tony Award-winning musical comedy S
 hucked makes its IU Auditorium debut in 2027.</p><p>  &#160\;</p><p>  Mai
 zy and Beau are getting hitched\, when the corn that protects their small
  community starts to die. The town needs answers. But who will dare ventu
 re beyond the borders of Cob County?</p><p>  &#160\;</p><p>  Including th
 e knockout songs "Woman of the World\," "Somebody Will\," and "Independen
 tly Owned\," this Broadway hit about an unlikely hero\, an unscrupulous c
 on artist\, and a battle for the heart and soil of a small town\, is not 
 to be missed.</p>
