 06428328ed/6a1f1f829301fa25d838b93f/scaled_1024.jpg
X-TKF-CUSTOM-PREVIEW:Constellation Stage & Screen presents “An Enemy of t
 he People” on stage February 4th-21st at the Waldron Auditorium. This Ton
 y-nominated adaptation of Henrik...
LOCATION:Waldron Arts Center\,122 S Walnut St\, Bloomington\, IN 47404\, 
 USA
